Project Kuja {
  database_type: 'PostgreSQL'
  Note: '''
    (c) Nyimbi Odero, 2024, nyimbi@gmail.com, MIT Licensed
    Implement: PostgreSQL + PostGIS for waypoints + pgrouting for OSPF
    
    
    Conventions:
      Identifier keys need to end or be id, _id
      Foreign keys need to end if _id_fkey, _id_fk
      Association Tables need to end in _map, _link, _assoc

    Principal Entities
    X Accounting: GL + Accounts
    X People: Orgs, People
    X Calendar + Reminders
    X Document Management, Scanning, OCR
    X Association Membership Management
    X Customer Relationship Management
    
    People are organized into orgs. Orgs may have sub-orgs
    For each org we generate a website/profile page
    producs have product classes.
    orgs may have products
    each org may price products differntly
    orgs may accept, reject quotes
    orgs may issue invoices
    invoices can be paid in full or in part
    invoices are posted to the orgs GL
    Can track Quotes, Sales Orders, Purchase Orders, Invoices, Inventory Orders
    We can receive funds and loan them to orgs
    Lesson planning + Content Management System


    TODO
    - Rating Engine
    - Adaptive Learning
    '''
 }


